OL,3,GNEWSABritish Musical Fireworks
OL,4,AChampionship: All you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Musical Fireworks
OL,7,FChampionship will take place at
OL,8,FVictoria Park in Southport on Saturday
OL,9,Fand Sunday.
OL,11,FThe national pyrotechnic competition
OL,12,Fwill see professional teams synchronise
OL,13,Ffireworks displays to music, creating a
OL,14,Fspectacular audio-visual show on
OL,15,FMerseyside.
OL,17,FHere is everything you need to know
OL,18,Fahead of the event.
OL,20,FThe event takes place in the town's
OL,21,FVictoria Park on Saturday and Sunday
OL,22,Fbetween 17:30 BST and 21:30.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
